          a: 0,
          why: "<b>Estrogen is the gold standard</b> for vasomotor symptoms (about a 75% reduction), and with a <b>uterus you must add a progestogen</b> to prevent endometrial hyperplasia and cancer. She's under 60 and within 10 years of menopause with no contraindications: the group with the most benefit and least risk.",
