          a: 0,
          why: "<b>POI</b> is onset <b>before 40</b>, diagnosed by <b>irregular periods with an FSH over 25</b> on two occasions; then work up genetic, thyroid and autoimmune causes. Early menopause is onset between 40 and 45. Hypothalamic amenorrhea would give a low FSH.",
