          a: 0,
          why: "GSM is <b>progressive and doesn't resolve on its own</b>. After lifestyle, lubricants, moisturizers and pelvic physio, <b>local estrogen is the mainstay</b> (DHEA and ospemifene are alternatives). Low estrogen means no glycogen and no lactobacilli, so the pH climbs above 5.",
