          a: 0,
          why: "Atypia changes everything: up to 29% malignancy risk, and <b>30–40% already have carcinoma</b> in the uterus. So management is <b>surgical: hysterectomy with BSO</b>. High-dose progesterone is only for when surgery is contraindicated.",
